      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">EsTex Foundation with EsTex, a comprehensive stakeholder mapping was conducted to develop an in-depth understanding on the current challenges in the textile sectors, identify potential stakeholders and collaborative partners to design possible solutions. Stakeholder consultation workshop has been organized to initiate dialogues and create a platform for policy makers and sectoral stakeholders for highlighting the policy gaps and constraints, exploring new opportunities and pathways of implementing solutions to the environmental, social and economic issues pertaining with the effluent management system of textile and apparel sector of Bangladesh. Following the workshop, a newspaper supplement was released to reach the mass on the policy issues for sustainable textiles in Bangladesh</narrative>
